"desc": "🎃👻 GET READY FOR OUR 7TH ANNUAL TRUNK OR TREAT! 👻🎃\n\nIt’s officially spooky season, and one of our favorite community traditions is BACK for its 7th year! Join us for a Halloween celebration filled with candy, costumes, games, activities, local vendors, and plenty of family-friendly fun!\n\n📍 Where: Club Pilates Teasley Commons — 3220 Teasley Lane, Denton, TX 76210\n📅 When: October 16, 2026\n⏰Time: 4:30pm-7:30pm\n💰 FREE to attend | Fun for all ages!\n\n 👻 WHAT IS TRUNK OR TREAT?\n\nInstead of trick-or-treating door-to-door, families can stroll through a parking lot filled with creatively decorated cars, each transformed into its own Halloween-themed experience! 🎃\n\nEvery “trunk” brings something different — from candy and games to prizes, giveaways, and spooky surprises. It’s a fun, family-friendly way to celebrate Halloween while bringing our local community together!\n\n🎃 WHAT CAN YOU EXPECT?\n\n🍬 Decorated Trunks — Explore creative Halloween-themed trunks filled with candy, games, prizes, and giveaways!\n\n🎪 Local Vendors & Businesses — Shop, connect, discover new local businesses, and enjoy offerings from some of our amazing community partners!\n\n🎨 Halloween Activities — Enjoy fun, hands-on activities and creative stations throughout the event.\n\n👻 Costume Contest — Come dressed to impress for your chance to win a prize!\n\n🎃 Pumpkin Decorating Station — Get creative and make your own Halloween masterpiece!\n\n💀 Crazy & Creepy Hair Decorating — Add a little extra spooky flair to your Halloween look!\n\n🪄 Bounce Houses — Let the kids jump, play, and burn off some of that candy-fueled energy!\n\n🎟️ Raffles & Giveaways — Enter for your chance to win exciting prizes, services, and goodies from our participating businesses!\n\n\n🧡 SUPPORTING OUR LOCAL COMMUNITY\n\nOur Trunk or Treat is more than just a Halloween event — it’s a celebration of the Denton community!\n\nWe’re proud to bring together local businesses, organizations, families, and community members to create a fun, welcoming, and memorable experience for everyone. Our vendors and community partners play a huge part in making this event possible, and we’re so excited to continue growing this tradition year after year!\n\n\n🎪 LOCAL BUSINESSES — JOIN US!\n\nWe’re still accepting local businesses and vendors who would like to be part of the fun!🎃\n\nWhether you’re a small business, local organization, service provider, or community group, we’d love to have you join us and connect with hundreds of local families while helping us make this year’s Trunk or Treat the best one yet!\n\nInterested in becoming a vendor or community partner? Send us a message to learn more and reserve your spot!\n\n\n👻 COME CELEBRATE WITH US!\n\nFor seven years, our Trunk or Treat has brought families and local businesses together for a Halloween celebration that is safe, welcoming, and full of community spirit.\n\nSo grab your costumes, bring your candy bags, invite your friends, and get ready for a morning full of candy, creativity, local businesses, and a whole lot of Halloween magic! 🎃👻✨\n\nWe can’t wait to celebrate our 7th Annual Trunk or Treat with you!\n\n🎃 FREE EVENT • ALL AGES WELCOME • COSTUMES ENCOURAGED",
