"desc": "We're bringing back one of our favorite Halloween tradition and things are about to get wonderfully weird!\nWatch as local artists go head-to-head in a live painting battle, transforming ordinary thrift store paintings into spooky, creepy, hilarious, and downright bizarre works of art!\nThe challenge? Take a perfectly innocent thrift store painting and give it a Halloween makeover. The original artwork has to remain part of the masterpiece, so creativity is everything!\n👻 AND HERE'S WHERE YOU COME IN!\nYOU get to be the judge! Throughout the night, the crowd will vote as the artists paint live, watching these thrift store treasures turn into something completely unexpected.\n🏆 Battle Categories:\nMost Cursed – The painting that might actually be haunted.\nBest Transformation – The most creative makeover.\nPeople's Choice – The crowd favorite!\nCome grab a drink, cheer on your favorite artists, cast your votes, and watch the madness unfold. You never know what these artists will come up with!\n🕤 Live Painting Battle: 9:30–11:30 PM\n📍 Yellow Dog Art Bar | Denton, TX\nWhether you're an art lover, a Halloween fanatic, or just enjoy watching creative people do questionable things to thrift store paintings, this is your kind of night.\nFour years of turning thrift store art into beautiful nightmares. Come help us crown this year's winners!\nFREE TO WATCH! Bring your friends, grab a cocktail, and let the spooky creativity begin!",
