"desc": "Looking for a frightfully fun way to spend your Sunday while supporting a wonderful local cause? Join Span Inc./Meals on Wheels Denton County for Spooktacular, an afternoon filled with Halloween fun, food, Spooky Bingo, and a Mega-Raffle featuring exciting prizes!\n\nBring your friends, family, and coworkers and get ready to play, laugh, and enjoy a festive afternoon together. Whether you’re a bingo regular or simply looking for a fun way to celebrate the season, Spooktacular offers an opportunity to connect with the community while making a meaningful difference for seniors throughout Denton County.\n\nProceeds from the event will support Meals on Wheels Denton County and programs such as PAWS. Meals on Wheels provides hot, nutritious meals and friendly visits to homebound seniors and people with disabilities. PAWS supplies pet food to qualifying homebound clients, helping seniors continue caring for and enjoying the companionship of the pets they love.\n\nSpan has served the Denton County community since 1974, helping older adults, people with disabilities, veterans, and other neighbors live as fully and independently as possible. By attending Spooktacular, you’ll help continue this important work—and have a spookily good time while doing it!\n\nEvent Details\n\nSunday, October 25, 2026\n12:00–4:00 p.m.\nVFW, 909 Sunset Street, Denton, TX 76201\nAdmission: $30\n\nTickets are limited, so invite your favorite people and reserve your spot today!\n\nPurchase tickets: span-transit.org/events\n\nFor additional information, please call Span Inc./Meals on Wheels Denton County at (940) 382-2224.",
